  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SEMIExpo Vietnam 2025 co-host</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Vietnam is emerging as a key player in high-tech manufacturing, particularly in semiconductors.The Netherlands, through its strategic interest, supports the development of Vietnam&#x2019;s semiconductor industry to diversify global supply and strengthen economic resilience. Following up on the success at SEMIEXPO Vietnam 2024, the embassy will co-organise a conference, matchmaking event and networking reception during SEMIEXPO Vietnam 2025 in Hanoi. The project aims to:1.	Enhance the understanding of Vietnamese companies regarding the requirements and opportunities to participate in the global semiconductor equipment supply chain; and2.	Facilitate matchmaking between local suppliers and international buyers, including pre-arranged one-on-one business meetings.</narrative>
  </description>
